# Pinned agent image versions (2026.<m>.<d>-g<sha> — consistent with the deploy versioning). Sourced by
# agents/{agent-session,coordinator-session,reviewer-session}.sh; also mirrored (pinned literal) in
# the agents/coordinator/*-argo.yaml + transcripts-*.yaml manifests — since 2026-07-25 the
# deploy-pin job bumps ALL of them via a git-grep sweep, no manual mirroring. Bumped by the image
# repos' deploy-pin PRs (agent-runtime →
# AGENT_BASE_IMAGE, agent-coordinator → AGENT_COORDINATOR_IMAGE). Pinned (NOT :latest) → k8s uses
# imagePullPolicy IfNotPresent by default (no pullAlways), cacheable, traceable to the build commit.
AGENT_BASE_IMAGE=ghcr.io/teststuffstash/agent-base:2026.9.4-g64242083980d
AGENT_COORDINATOR_IMAGE=ghcr.io/teststuffstash/agent-coordinator:2026.8.7-gd6dc9ced82f2
# dind sidecar for docker-mode workers (AgentStack fixer.docker; docs/spikes/kata-ci-gate.md).
# Digest-pinned: the mutable :5-dind tag cost the kata spike 3 attempts of confounders.
AGENT_DIND_IMAGE=ghcr.io/k3d-io/k3d:5-dind@sha256:ee3872700ed070566d3680e4926d8d60b1f0d3a948e595fec52103c2ae758921
